      "interpretation": "LC-MS/MS analysis of 40 PFAS analytes before and after HALT with the proprietary catalyst shows >99% reduction in total PFAS for all tests, similar to non-catalytic runs, but with a greater extent of destruction at shorter residence time. The 6 h catalytic test achieves an additional order-of-magnitude reduction in remaining total PFAS compared with the non-catalytic 6 h test. Authors refer to this as enhanced PFAS destruction rate and extent; endpoint is reduction of targeted PFAS concentrations.",
