      "interpretation": "As in non-catalytic tests, only PFAS species present in the initial AFFF are detected in catalytic-treated samples, even where method detection limits are lower (notably in the 6 h catalytic test), suggesting reaction and mineralization of PFAS without formation of new detectable PFAS transformation products within the targeted list.",
